          "solution": "$\\log_2$ probabilities: $-1, -2, -1, -3$ → sum $-7$ → average $-1.75$.\n$$\\mathrm{PPL} = 2^{-\\frac{1}{M}\\sum_t \\log_2 p(y_t)} = 2^{1.75} \\approx 3.3636$$\nCheck: it sits between 1 (perfect) and $|V|$ (uniform).",
